      #10#13#10'    pre {'#13#10'        padding: 14px;'#13#10'    }'#13#10'}'
    Zoom = 1.000000000000000000
    Align = Client
    Size.Width = 853.000000000000000000
    Size.Height = 450.000000000000000000
    Size.PlatformDefault = False
    TabOrder = 2
    Markdown.Strings = (
      '## '#55357#56513' Choose Your Folder'
      ''
      'Select the folder where your system folders are stored.'
      ''
      'The folder can be located:'
      ''
      '* On your **PC**'
      '* On your **Raspberry Pi**'
      ''
      '### Raspberry Pi'
      ''
      
        'If you select a folder on the Raspberry Pi, you will be prompted' +
        ' with a message explaining that **EmulationStation will be stopp' +
        'ed** in order to save your changes to `gamelist.xml`.'
      ''
      
        'When you close the application, **Recalbox/RetroPie will be rebo' +
        'oted** so that your changes take effect.'
      ''
      '---'
      ''
      '## '#9999#65039' Editing Fields'
      ''
      
        'To modify a field, you must first **check the checkbox next to i' +
        't**.'
      ''
      
        'This is intentional and prevents accidentally changing the conte' +
        'nts of fields.'
      ''
      '---'
      ''
      '## '#9881#65039' Options'
      ''
      '### Enable God Mode'
      ''
      
        'Enables the ability to **delete games directly from the applicat' +
        'ion**.'
      ''
      
        'A **Delete** button will be added to the interface. When clicked' +
        ', you will be asked to confirm the deletion.'
      ''
      'Deleting a game will:'
      ''
      '* Remove its entry from `gamelist.xml`'
      '* Delete the associated picture'
      '* Delete the associated video'
      '* Delete the ROM file from your folder'
      ''
      
        '> '#9888#65039' **Warning:** Deleted files cannot be recovered by the appli' +
        'cation.'
      ''
      '### Delete Without Prompt'
      ''
      'Disables the confirmation dialog when deleting a game.'
      ''
      '> '#9888#65039' **Use with caution.**'
      ''
      '### Disable Pi Prompts'
      ''
      'Disables all confirmation messages related to:'
      ''
      '* Stopping EmulationStation'
      '* Rebooting Recalbox/RetroPie'
      ''
      '### Auto Hash'
      ''
      'Automatically hashes ROM files when you click **More Infos**.'
      ''
      
        'Recommended if you have a powerful computer or if your systems c' +
        'ontain mostly small ROM files.'
      ''
      
        '> '#9888#65039' Hashing can be **very slow**, especially for large files. U' +
        'se this option with caution.'
      ''
      
        'If this option is disabled, you will be asked whether you want t' +
        'o hash the file when clicking **More Infos**.'
      ''
      '### Show Tips at Start'
      ''
      'Shows the help window when the application starts.'
      ''
      'You can disable it in either of two ways:'
      ''
      '1. Disable **Show tips at start**.'
      
        '2. Check **Don'#39't show again** in the help window before closing ' +
        'it.'
      ''
      '### Use Genesis Logo'
      ''
      'Uses the **Genesis** logo and name instead of **Mega Drive**.'
      ''
      '---'
      ''
      '## '#55357#56592' SSH / Configuration'
      ''
      
        'Opens a popup window where you can configure the **Login** and *' +
        '*Password** used to connect to Recalbox/RetroPie.'
      ''
      
        'Default values are filled in on the first launch. Your settings ' +
        'will be saved for subsequent launches.'
      ''
      '---'
      ''
      '# '#55357#57056#65039' System Operations'
      ''
      
        'The following operations apply to **all games in the currently s' +
        'elected system**.'
      ''
      '### Convert to Lowercase'
      ''
      
        'Converts all text to lowercase for every game in the selected sy' +
        'stem.'
      ''
      '### Convert to Uppercase'
      ''
      
        'Converts all text to uppercase for every game in the selected sy' +
        'stem.'
      ''
      '### Remove Region from Game Names'
      ''
      'Removes region tags from game names.'
      ''
      'For example:'
      ''
      '```text'
      'Super Mario World [USA]'
      '```'
      ''
      'becomes:'
      ''
      '```text'
      'Super Mario World'
      '```'
      ''
      '### Delete Orphans from Gamelist'
      ''
      
        'Removes games from `gamelist.xml` that are no longer physically ' +
        'present on your drive.'
      ''
      
        'An **orphan** is a game that is listed in `gamelist.xml`, but wh' +
        'ose associated ROM file no longer exists.'
      ''
      '### Delete Duplicates from Gamelist'
      ''
      'Removes duplicate game entries from `gamelist.xml`.'
      ''
      
        'If the same game is listed two or more times, only one entry wil' +
        'l remain.'
      ''
      '---'
      ''
      '# '#55356#57262' Game Operations'
      ''
      
        'The following operations apply only to the **currently selected ' +
        'game**.'
      ''
      '### Convert to Lowercase'
      ''
      'Converts all text to lowercase for the selected game.'
      ''
      '### Convert to Uppercase'
      ''
      'Converts all text to uppercase for the selected game.')
  end
end
